lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP 3.1.12 was built but had =
autobuilder failures so is also being =
discussed.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>A request was made to continue =
hardknott support in the community and this was agreed until Feb/March =
next year but will not overlap the LTS.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Patches to guard against poor =
performance if servers are unresponsive have been merged along with =
mirror urls for key components. These should make the system more robust =
and allow builds to work with infrastructure outages. Fixes are in =
master and dunfell with hardknott and honister due to have the backports =
as well.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Packagegroups which are also =
allarch will now raise errors if they depend on anything using the PKG: =
package renaming mechanism (e.g. debian.bbclass =
renaming).<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We continue to see a reduction =
in the number of patches in &#8220;Pending&#8221; state. Many thanks to =
everyone who has taken the time to review patch status and handle =
accordingly, particularly where they were accepted =
upstream.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Intermittent issues continue to =
rise and help is very much welcome on these issues. You can see the list =
of failures we&#8217;re continuing to see by searching for the =
&#8220;AB-INT&#8221; tag in bugzilla: <a =
href=3D"https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/buglist.cgi?quicksearch=3DAB-IN=
